+### If CORS Still Blocks
+
+**Cause:** Origin mismatch or duplicate CORS layers  
+
+**Solution:**
+1. Verify request origin exactly matches ALLOWED_ORIGINS
+2. Check for duplicate CORS headers (hosting + function)
